 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Forty days in the wilderness, forty nights alone",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": null,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Sun like a hammer and sand like a bone",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 36.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Then a voice came out of the heat haze, smooth as oil",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 27.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "If you are the Son of God, tell these stones to become bread",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 29.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "It is written",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 3,
   "error_s": null,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Man shall not live by bread alone",
   "heard": 0,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": null,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "But by every word that comes from the mouth of God",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 47.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "It is written",
   "heard": 0,
   "words": 3,
   "error_s": null,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Up on the temple's edge, the city far below",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 59.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Throw yourself down, the angels will catch you, you know",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 66.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Up on the mountain, all the kingdoms shining bright",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.9,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "All of this is yours if you bow down tonight",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "It is written",
